T*
(bottom. Once a condition evaluates to True, its block executes and the remaining) Tj
T*
(ladder is completely bypassed.) Tj
T*
(* 4. Nested Conditionals: if statements placed inside other if or else blocks. Code) Tj
T*
(readability maintained via consistent 4-space indentation.) Tj
