(* Function Syntax: def function_name\(param1, param2=default\): followed by docstring,) Tj
T*
(body, and return statement.) Tj
T*
(* Parameter Passing Semantics: Pass-by-Object-Reference \(Call-by-Assignment\):) Tj
T*
(- Immutable arguments \(int, float, str, tuple\): Behave like call-by-value; caller) Tj
T*
(variable remains unmodified.) Tj
T*
(- Mutable arguments \(list, dict, set\): Modified in-place inside function; changes) Tj
T*
(reflect in caller.) Tj
T*
(* Argument Classification:) Tj
T*
(- Positional Arguments: Mapped in order of appearance.) Tj
T*
(- Keyword Arguments: Explicitly specified by name \(e.g. func\(b=2, a=1\)\), order) Tj
T*
(independent.) Tj
T*
(- Default Arguments: Assigned default value in header. Warning: Never use mutable) Tj
T*
(objects \(like []\) as default arguments!) Tj
T*
(- Variable-Length Arguments: *args collects extra positional arguments into a tuple;) Tj
T*
(**kwargs collects extra keyword arguments into a dictionary.) Tj
T*
