(Problem Context: Generate all prime numbers in an engineering range and decompose) Tj
T*
(composite numbers into prime factors using for-else loops.) Tj
T*
(Python Source Code:) Tj
T*
(def find_primes_in_range\(start, end\):) Tj
T*
(primes = []) Tj
T*
(for num in range\(start, end + 1\):) Tj
T*
(if num < 2:) Tj
T*
(continue) Tj
T*
