/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
([PROGRAM 3: Taylor Series Approximation of Sine using Recursive Factorial]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: Compute sin\(x\) using Taylor series expansion up to N terms and compare) Tj
T*
(accuracy against math.sin\(\).) Tj
T*
(Python Source Code:) Tj
T*
(import math) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(def factorial_rec\(n\):) Tj
T*
(if n <= 1:) Tj
T*
(return 1) Tj
T*
(return n * factorial_rec\(n - 1\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(def taylor_sin\(x_rad, terms=7\):) Tj
T*
(# sin\(x\) = sum_{k=0}^{terms-1} \(-1\)^k * x^\(2k+1\) / \(2k+1\)!) Tj
T*
(sin_approx = 0.0) Tj
T*
(for k in range\(terms\):) Tj
T*
(numerator = \(\(-1\)**k\) * \(x_rad**\(2 * k + 1\)\)) Tj
T*
(denominator = factorial_rec\(2 * k + 1\)) Tj
T*
(sin_approx += numerator / denominator) Tj
T*
(return sin_approx) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
